      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA ADIRA (1) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from three starts. Recorded a 1.75 lengths win (30.64) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks the one to beat with even luck. DURAN PANTERA (7) is a fast beginner but out of character last time when always well back and missed the placings, finishing sixth (31.28) in a OPEN at Gawler. Prior to that was quickly into stride and scored (31.28) at Gawler. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from eight starts. Comes out of a solid form race last start. In the mix. CROCODILE ROLL (5) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 1.75 lengths into second (31.05) at Gawler in a OPEN over 531m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Expecting another good run. WOODSIDE JOHNNY (3) will make his presence felt following a brief layoff.",
